{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Enter: Naruto Uzumaki!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Welcome to the Village Hidden in the Leaves, where deadly serious Ninja roam the landscape and the seriously mischievous Naruto Uzumaki causes trouble everywhere he goes. But when he steals the ancient scroll of sealing, he unleashes a rare power rarely seen in a 12-year-old boy!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296975.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"参上! うずまきナルト\"},{\"title\":\"My Name Is Konohamaru!\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto finally graduates from the Ninja Academy and claims to know it all. Well, at least that what he tells Konohamaru, the Village elder's pint-size grandson. Much to the dismay of Ebisu, Konohamaru's teacher and mentor, Naruto teaches him the hormonally lethal \\\"Sexy Jutsu!\\\"\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296976.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉丸だ コレ!\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke and Sakura: Friends or Foes?\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is preparing himself for the Genin orientation. It's all a happy story until Sensei picks a team for all the ninjas. Naruto was teamed up with his crush, Sakura, and his worst enemy, Sasuke. Can Naruto learn to work together with two people whom despise him?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296977.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"宿敵!? サスケとサクラ\"},{\"title\":\"Pass or Fail: Survival Test\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto finally meets his new sensei. His name is Kakashi Hatake. He tells the group that before they could become Genin, they will have to pass his survival test. The problem is, the test has a 66% chance of failure, and if they fail they'll be sent back to the academy. To make matters even worse, one of them will fail no matter what. Can the three pass Kakashi's test?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296978.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"試練! サバイバル演習\"},{\"title\":\"You Failed! Kakashi`s Final Decision\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2002-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Time is running out for Naruto and his group. With Sasuke the only one left, he tries to succeed where the others failed. Will they be able to get the bells before time runs out?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296979.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"失格? カカシの結論\"},{\"title\":\"A Dangerous Mission! Journey to the Land of Waves!\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tired of doing lame missions, Naruto asks the Hokage to give them something challenging. The Hokage caves and gives them a C-rank mission. They will be bodyguards for a bridge builder. It appears to be a simple mission, until the group is attacked by something more than common thugs...other ninja!\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296980.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"重要任務! 波の国へ超出発!\"},{\"title\":\"The Assassin of the Mist!\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi and Tazuna are on their way to his home. On the way there they run across a ninja named, Zabuza Momochi. Is the Sharingan enough to defeat this new enemy, or is team Kakashi's first mission over before its even begun?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296981.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"霧の暗殺者!\"},{\"title\":\"The Oath of Pain\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Kakashi captured, Naruto, Sasuke and Sakura must defend against Zabuza's attacks. Naruto realizes that working together with Sasuke may be the only way to save Kakashi. Will the combined effort of the two be enough to free Kakashi and defeat Zabuza?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296982.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"痛みに誓う決意\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi: Sharingan Warrior!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2002-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Kakashi free, the fight between him and Zabuza resumes. Kakashi decides to show Zabuza what the Sharingan is really capable of. Can Kakashi's Sharingan defeat Zabuza? And who is the mysterious person watching the fight?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296983.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"写輪眼のカカシ\"},{\"title\":\"The Forest of Chakra\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Zabuza gone things are now settling and Tazuna can go and build the bridge without fear. Or so everyone thinks. Kakashi believes something is wrong with Zabuza's death and teaches Naruto, Sakura, and Sasuke a way to train so they could better use their chakra. Is Zabuza really dead?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296984.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"チャクラの森\"},{\"title\":\"The Land Where a Hero Once Lived\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Naruto and Sasuke train, Sakura watches over Tazuna. During a nice dinner, Sakura notices a man's face torn from a picture. The man's name was Kaiza, and he was what the country called...a \\\"hero\\\". What happened to cause Inari so much pain?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296985.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"英雄のいた国\"},{\"title\":\"Battle on the Bridge! Zabuza Returns!\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto has a dangerous encounter with Haku in the forest, but is Haku there to cause trouble? Naruto and Sasuke better complete their training, as Zabuza is alive and has returned for round 2. Will Kakashi, Sasuke, and Sakura be able to defeat the Demon of the Mist? And, can Naruto arrive in time to help out?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296986.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"橋上決戦! ザブザ再び!!\"},{\"title\":\"Haku`s Secret Jutsu: Crystal Ice Mirrors\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2002-12-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Round two with Zabuza has started, but this time… Zabuza has Haku fighting along side him. Haku and Sasuke go at it with Sasuke falling behind until he manages to get a kick in. Meanwhile Naruto deals with some of Gato's henchmen. Back at the bridge Haku uses his secret jutsu, Demonic Ice Mirrors. What does this jutsu hold in store for Sasuke? Will Naruto make it to the bridge in time and save Tsunami and Inari as well?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296987.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"白の秘術・魔鏡氷晶\"},{\"title\":\"The Number One Hyperactive, Knucklehead Ninja Joins the Fight!\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto finally joins the battle on the bridge. But when Naruto stupidly gets caught in the middle of Haku's jutsu as well, he and Sasuke must work together to escape. Kakashi is unable to help them, as he must deal with Zabuza to protect Sakura and Tazuna. How will the two escape from the ice mirrors without any help?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296988.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"意外性No.1, ナルト参戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Zero Visibility: The Sharingan Shatters\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke continue to fight Haku and are getting beaten bad. After having Naruto try and escape a few times, Sasuke begins to see a pattern. Meanwhile, outside Kakashi and Zabuza begin their fight. Can Naruto and Sasuke escape from Haku's jutsu? What plan does Zabuza have to defeat the Sharingan?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296989.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"視界ゼロの戦い・写輪眼崩し\"},{\"title\":\"The Broken Seal\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke continue their rigorous battle against Haku. When Haku targets a vulnerable Naruto, Sasuke risks everything to save him. Seeing his friend lie before him, a powerful force awakens inside Naruto. Has Kyubi been set free. If so, can anyone stop him?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296990.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"解放された封印\"},{\"title\":\"White Past: Hidden Ambition\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2003-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto takes out his rage on Haku, who doesn't stand a chance. However, Naruto realises that Haku is the boy he met back at the forest. Haku tells Naruto the story of his past and asks for Naruto to do him one favour..... Will Naruto do the one thing he could never do just as Haku wishes?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296991.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"白い過去・秘めた想い\"},{\"title\":\"The Weapons Known as Shinobi\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi prepares to stop Zabuza once and for all, but Haku has other plans. Zabuza's employer shows up and he's decided to take matters into his own hands...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296992.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"忍という名の道具\"},{\"title\":\"The Demon in the Snow\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zabuza is no longer Kakashi's enemy, and thanks to a little speech by Naruto about how ninja are, Zabuza takes on Gato's men single handedly. The Demon of the Hidden Mist takes his vengeance on Gato and all of those dumb enough to follow him, and apologizes to Haku for what he did to the kind little boy. After the group takes care of the rest of Gato's men, Zabuza asks Kakashi one final request, to see Haku one final time. This is Zabuza's requiem.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296993.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ザブザ雪に散る...\"},{\"title\":\"A New Chapter Begins: The Chunin Exam!\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With their latest mission complete, it's time once again for the group to go back to mediocre missions. After all are done, Konohamaru and his friends pay a visit to Naruto. All which result in being chased by Sakura. Everyone is soon over though, as two mysterious ninja block their way, and one of them isn't too happy with Konohamaru. Sasuke arrives to save the day, but the leader of the group shows up, with stealth skills that surprise even Sasuke. Meanwhile, the Third Hokage announces that it's time once again for the Chuunin selection exams.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296994.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"新章突入! 中忍試験だってばよ\"},{\"title\":\"Identify Yourself: Powerful New Rivals\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2003-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the three ninjas take their leave, Sasuke realizes he has a powerful rival out there. The next day, Kakashi announces that he has recommended all of them for the Chuunin Exams. While Naruto and Sasuke are pleased, Sakura is afraid of letting everyone down. Also, someone decides they aren't ready and decides to test their abilities.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296995.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"名乗れ! 現れた強敵たち!!\"},{\"title\":\"Chunin Challenge: Rock Lee vs. Sasuke!\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rock Lee challenges Sasuke to a one-on-one fight. Naruto grows angry and attacks him, only to be beaten in one attack. Sasuke realizes the challenge and eagerly accepts. But will Sasuke be defeated just as easily by this mysterious ninja? Sasuke's only advantage seems to be his Sharingan, but what happens when not even that will work?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296996.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"気合い120% ナウでロックな挑戦状!\"},{\"title\":\"Genin Takedown! All Nine Rookies Face Off!\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A reunion of all the rookies isn't a very happy one, as all of them prepare to take the Chuunin Exam. With so many rivals around, Naruto's team will need help from a fellow ninja named Kabuto to know what they're up against. Will the group be able to last through the exam?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296997.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"蹴散らせライバル! 新人9人[ルーキーナイン]全員集合\"},{\"title\":\"Start Your Engines: The Chunin Exam Begins\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The first test of the Chuunin Exam is just that, a written test. When Ibiki issues a strict set of rules, Naruto fails to realize that the objective of the test is to cheat without getting caught. Can Naruto realize the truth before time runs out? And what about the tenth question?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296998.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"いきなり失格? 超難関の第一試験\"},{\"title\":\"The Tenth Question: All or Nothing!\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2003-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As time ticks away, Naruto's only hope of passing the test lies in the final question. However, there is a requirement to answering the final question. If you choose not to answer it, you fail the test and can try again next time. But, if you choose to answer it and get it wrong, you can never take the test again and must stay a Genin forever! What will Naruto's choice be?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/296999.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"出たとこ勝負! 踏ん張りどころの10問目\"},{\"title\":\"Special Report: Live from the Forest of Death!\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Before the second exam can begin, Konohamaru and his friends pull the members of Team 7 aside for interviews, where they retell the storyline to this point.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297001.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"絶対必見! 死の森直前ルポ! 木ノ葉の学級新聞だコレ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Chunin Exam Stage 2: The Forest of Death\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The second exam is about to begin, and every ninja must sign a form so that their team can get either the Heaven or Earth Scroll. The goal is to get one of each scroll and make it to the tower in five days. The groups get their scrolls and the exam begins. Naruto is ambushed by a ninja who poses as him. This ninja doesn't fool Sasuke, who immediately figures it out. Meanwhile, a new foe seeks them out, but who is this foe?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297002.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"第二試験スタート! 周りはみんな敵だらけ!\"},{\"title\":\"Eat or Be Eaten: Panic in the Forest\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To prevent further problems, Sasuke thinks up a password to determine friend from foe, but will it be that simple? Meanwhile Naruto has his hands full with a giant snake. Can he handle this on his own and what about Sasuke and Sakura, can they survive the ordeal?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297000.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"喰うか喰われるか! エサになったナルト\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Counterattack: Never Give In!\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke is about to give up and give their scroll to the enemy, when Naruto stops him and accuses him of being a fake. Naruto then turns his attention to the Grass Ninja.... The battle is intense and when the Grass Ninja appears to get the upper hand, can Sasuke muster up the courage to fight?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297003.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト反撃! 逃げねーんだってばよ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Sharingan Revived: Dragon Flame Jutsu!\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke is still stuck in his trance and even Sakura's pleas can't get him back to normal. Meanwhile, Anko searches for the grass ninja fake. When the team appear to get the upper hand the question begs to be asked. Are the ninja truly defeated, or is there more to them than meets the eye?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297004.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"蘇れ写輪眼! 必殺・火遁龍火[かとんりゅうか]の術!\"},{\"title\":\"Bushy Brow`s Pledge: Undying Love and Protection\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2003-04-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Since Sakura was the only one who did not get injured in the previous battle she must watch over and protect her teammates. Unknown to her though, there are enemies watching from the trees.... They attack, but a friend arrives to help. Will it be enough?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297005.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"激まゆプラトニック! 僕は死ぬまでアナタを守る!!\"},{\"title\":\"Sakura Blossoms!\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lee in his weakened state is having trouble defeating Dosu. Sakura realises everyone has been protecting her until now and that its her time to protect them! Can Sakura succeed where even Lee failed?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297006.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"サクラ咲く! 決意の後ろ姿\"},{\"title\":\"Battle Formation: Ino-Shika-Cho!\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Sakura defeated and facing certain death, more reinforcements step into the fray. However, they sense an even bigger level of power, and its not coming from the sound trio! Meanwhile Sasuke wakes up with an ominous dark aura surrounding him and the mysterious seal spreading over his body. He has but one goal....make his enemies pay!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297007.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"無敵のフォーメーション! いのシカチョウ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Akamaru Trembles: Gaara`s Cruel Strength!\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kiba, Shino, and Hinata decide to try and eliminate their opponents by taking more scrolls. They arrive upon a battlefield where three Rain ninjas are battling Gaara, Kankuro, and Temari. They remain hidden and observe the battle, thinking one of the Rain ninjas is a dangerous foe. After realizing Gaara's amazing abilities, they discover who is the really the dangerous one, and will be lucky if they can sneak away with their lives!\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297008.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"赤丸ビックリ! 我愛羅[ガアラ], 驚異の実力\"},{\"title\":\"The Scroll`s Secret: No Peeking Allowed\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2003-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Team Kakashi still has only one scroll and there is only a day left before the test ends. Naruto decides they need to make a fake scroll and goes to open their Earth scroll, when Kabuto shows up and stops him, explaining that the scroll will knock them out until after the exam ends. He then tells them he will help them find the scroll they need. They seem to be the ones on the hunt, but what happens when they fall into a trap set by the enemy?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297009.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"のぞき見厳禁! 巻き物の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Clone vs. Clone: Mine Are Better Than Yours!\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle of kings has begun as Orochimaru has summoned some unexpected help. How can the Third Hokage handle this uncomfortable situation? Meanwhile, Sasuke finally catches up with Kakurou, Gaara and Temari…\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297047.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"分身対決! オレが主役だってばよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Surviving the Cut! The Rookie Nine Together Again!\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Naruto and Sakura continue to catch up to Sasuke, Temari trys to stall Sasuke long enough for Kankuro to get Gaara to safety, but Sasuke doesn't have time to waste on her! Meanwhile, The Third Hokage continues his battle with Orochimaru and is ready to use a move that not even he knows...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297048.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"第二試験突破! 勢ぞろいルーキーナイン!\"},{\"title\":\"Narrowing the Field: Sudden Death Elimination!\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An unlikely ally appears to help Sasuke and allows him to continue to pursue Gaara. Meanwhile, the Hokage prepares to make the ultimate sacrifice to rid his village of Orochimaru!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297049.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"合格者二分の一!? イキナリ試合だってばよ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Bushy Brow`s Jealousy: Lions Barrage Unleashed!\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Shino and Kankuro fight the match they should've fought back during the Chuunin Exam, Naruto, Sakura, and Pakkun slowly catch up to Sasuke. Meanwhile, Sasuke has finally caught up with Gaara and Temari, but is he ready to face true horror when Gaara reveals his demon form?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297050.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ゲジまゆジェラシー!『獅子連弾』誕生!\"},{\"title\":\"Kakashi and Orochimaru: Face-to-Face!\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke struggles to keep up with Gaara's monstrous capacity. Only able to use Chidori twice in normal circumstances, Sasuke remembers that tragic day when his family died and realises he must risk the use of Chidori beyond his limit if he is to defeat Gaara. That is, if he can…\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297051.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"一触即発!!カカシVS大蛇丸\"},{\"title\":\"Kunoichi Rumble: The Rivals Get Serious!\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Sasuke is about to be defeated, Naruto and Sakura show up to save him. With this Gaara begins to have flashbacks of his childhood. What happened in Gaara's past to make him experience so much suffering?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297052.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ライバル激突! オトメ心は本気モード\"},{\"title\":\"The Ultimate Battle: Cha!\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gaara continues to talk about his past. When Gaara states that Naruto can't become stronger when he fights for everyone else, Naruto recalls that if he didn't meet his friends, he would be the same as Gaara. Realizing that he has to protect his friends, Naruto overcomes his fear and decides to take on Gaara.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297053.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ベストバトルはしゃーんなろー!!\"},{\"title\":\"Killer Kunoichi and a Shaky Shikamaru\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Gaara continue their fight.  Naruto begins to get an advantage, and Gaara transforms into the final form of Shukaku of the Sand. As he begins to put the squeeze on Naruto, Naruto summons Gamabunta Oyabun, and his comeback begins. Once again, Naruto begins to get an advantage, but Gaara casts the technique of fake sleep, releasing the full power of Shukaku. Now that the demon is free, what will Naruto do?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/421973.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"シカマルタジタジ!? くの一達の熱き戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Akamaru Unleashed! Who`s Top Dog Now?\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Transformed into Kyubi, Naruto and Gamabunta prepare to stop Shukaku by waking Gaara up. Though they succeed, the battle is far from over as Gaara won't stop until Naruto is dead. Naruto and Gaara prepare for their final attacks. Meanwhile, Sarutobi continues trying to defeat Orochimaru. And even though Sarutobi isn't strong enough to kill Orochimaru, he does have enough strength to take away Orochimaru's most prized possession...the use of his arms!\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297056.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"赤丸参戦!! 負け犬はどっちだ?\"},{\"title\":\"Surprise Attack! Naruto`s Secret Weapon!\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As the war draws to a close, Gaara admits his defeat to Naruto, and Orochimaru is forced to retreat as Sarutobi took away his arms. Now, all of the Konoha shinobi gather together to pay their respects to the person whom they respected the most… Sarutobi, the Third Hokage.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297057.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒナタ赤面! 観客あんぐり, ナルトの奥の手\"},{\"title\":\"Byakugan Battle: Hinata Grows Bold!\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Two mysterious ninja infiltrate Konoha, and one of them bares the Sharingan. Just what are these two after? Why has Itachi Uchiha returned to Konoha?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297058.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"白眼開眼!! 内気なヒナタの大胆決意!\"},{\"title\":\"A Failure Stands Tall!\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi takes on Itachi, with both of them using the Sharingan. However, Kakashi soon realizes that he stands no chance against the legendary ninja. Itachi reveals that he has not come for his little brother, but instead he's come to do something else… abduct Naruto, and Kyubi as well!\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297059.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"憧れの人の目の前で!!\"},{\"title\":\"Gaara vs. Rock Lee: The Power of Youth Explodes!\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya and Naruto begin their search for Tsunade, but are constantly sidetracked by Jiraiya's peeping and hitting on pretty girls. Jiraiya tells Naruto some stories about the 3rd and 4th Hokages. Meanwhile, Sasuke learns that his brother, Itachi, is after Naruto and goes to warn him.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/78857/297060.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"我愛羅粉砕!! 若さだ! パワーだ! 爆発だ!\"},{\"title\":\"Lee`s Hidden Strength: Forbidden Secret Jutsu!\",\"number\":49,\"airDate\":\"2003-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lee uses the banned technique Primary Lotus to attack Gaara.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱血落ちこぼれ! 遂に炸裂, 禁断の奥義!\"},{\"title\":\"The Fifth Gate: A Splendid Ninja Is Born\",\"number\":50,\"airDate\":\"2003-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lee decides to use the forbidden move, Hidden Lotus, as a last resort.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"嗚呼ロック・リー! これが男の生き様よ!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Shadow in Darkness: Danger Approaches Sasuke\",\"number\":51,\"airDate\":\"2003-09-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the final match of the preliminaries, Choji fights against Orochimaru`s minion Dosu. The preliminaries are finally over, and the Hokage reveals the third exam.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇にうごめく影 サスケに迫る危機!\"},{\"title\":\"Ebisu Returns: Naruto`s Toughest Training Yet!\",\"number\":52,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In preparation for the third exam that starts in a month, Naruto`s former mentor, Kakashi, chooses Ebisu to train the young ninja.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エビス再び! ハレンチは私が許しませんぞ!\"},{\"title\":\"Long Time No See: Jiraiya Returns!\",\"number\":53,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya, one of the legendary Three Ninja, suddenly appears before Ebisu and Naruto. Naruto gives Jiraiya the nickname, \\\"Pervy Sage.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"あいやしばらく! エロ仙人登場!\"},{\"title\":\"The Summoning Jutsu: Wisdom of the Toad Sage!\",\"number\":54,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Sound Ninja Dosu appears before Gaara and intends on defeating Gaara. But Gaara beats him soundly. Stealthily watching them are a Jonin of the Sand Village and Kabuto!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エロ仙人直伝 口寄せの術だってばよ!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Feeling of Yearning, A Flower Full of Hope\",\"number\":55,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto continues training under Jiraiya to master the \\\"Summoning Jutsu\\\" which enables him to call forth various living beasts. But he has a hard time controlling the Chakra of the Nine-Tailed Fox...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"切ない想い 願いを込めた一輪\"},{\"title\":\"Live or Die: Risk It All to Win It All!\",\"number\":56,\"airDate\":\"2003-10-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It is three weeks since Naruto began training under Jiraiya. And Naruto has been on the brink of collapse many times.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生か死か!? 免許皆伝は命懸け!\"},{\"title\":\"He Flies! He Jumps! He Lurks! Chief Toad Appears!\",\"number\":57,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is finally able to draw out the Nine-Tail Chakra and utilize the \\\"Summoning Jutsu.\\\" Gamabunta appears and does not believe that Naruto summoned him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"飛んだ! 跳ねた! 潜った! ガマ親分登場!!\"},{\"title\":\"Hospital Besieged: The Evil Hand Revealed!\",\"number\":58,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On the day of the test, Gaara disappears from the inn where the Sand Ninja are staying and goes to Hidden Leaf Hospital.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"しのび寄る魔の手! 狙われた病室\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Rounds: Rush to the Battle Arena!\",\"number\":59,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The day of the Exam finally arrives. Naruto’s first opponent is Neji Hyuga.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"モー烈 モー追 モーダッシュ 本選開始だってばよ\"},{\"title\":\"Byakugan vs. Shadow Clone Jutsu!\",\"number\":60,\"airDate\":\"2003-11-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Finally, Chunin Exam starts with the eight Ninja who qualified in the preliminaries. But Sasuke is nowhere to be found.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白眼VS影分身! オレはゼってー勝つ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Ultimate Defense: Zero Blind Spot!\",\"number\":61,\"airDate\":\"2003-12-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is unable to use his Shadow Clone Jutsu against Neji who can see chakra points!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死角ゼロ! もうひとつの絶対防御\"},{\"title\":\"A Failure`s True Power\",\"number\":62,\"airDate\":\"2003-12-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Neji’s battle continue with Neji showing enormous power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"落ちこぼれの底力!\"},{\"title\":\"Hit It or Quit It: The Final Rounds Get Complicated!\",\"number\":63,\"airDate\":\"2003-12-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Defeated by Naruto, Neji is being taken to the hospital, when Neji’s uncle Hiashi appears.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失格!? キケン! 前倒し! 波乱含みの大本選!\"},{\"title\":\"Zero Motivation: The Guy with Cloud Envy!\",\"number\":64,\"airDate\":\"2003-12-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke’s match is postponed and suddenly, it is Shikamaru’s turn. He has shown no eagerness to fight, thinking that his is merely a secondary match…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雲はいいなあ... やる気ゼロの男\"},{\"title\":\"Dancing Leaf, Squirming Sand\",\"number\":65,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Shikamaru and Temari’s match, Shikamaru who had the upper hand suddenly makes a surprising decision!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 木の葉舞い 砂うごめく瞬間[とき]\"},{\"title\":\"Bushy Brow`s Jutsu: Sasuke Style!\",\"number\":66,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke and Gaara’a anticipated match begins. Gaara eerily talks to himself, as though addressing someone.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"嵐を呼ぶ男!! サスケのゲジマユ流体術!\"},{\"title\":\"Late for the Show, but Ready to Go! The Ultimate Secret Technique Is Born!\",\"number\":67,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sauske`s speed and moves are identical to Lee’s Taijutsu. But Gaara is not an opponent who can be defeated with just Taijutsu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"だてに遅れたわけじゃない! 究極奥義・千鳥誕生!!\"},{\"title\":\"Zero Hour! The Destruction of the Hidden Leaf Village Begins!\",\"number\":68,\"airDate\":\"2004-01-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During the match, someone has used Genjutsu to put everyone in the arena to sleep. The Sand Ninja led by Orochimaru have begun their plan to destroy the Hidden Leaf Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"『木ノ葉崩し』始動!\"},{\"title\":\"Village in Distress: A New A-Ranked Mission!\",\"number\":69,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Sound and Sand Ninja, along with Orochimaru, begin their move to destroy Hidden Leaf Village. The arena has become a battleground.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"待ってました! Aランク任務だってばよ!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Shirker`s Call to Action: Layabout No More!\",\"number\":70,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Along with Pakkun, Naruto, Sakura and Shikamaru are in hot pursuit of Sasuke. Pakkun senses nine of Orochimaru`s men coming after them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逃げ腰NO.1 めんどくせーがやるっきゃねえ!!\"},{\"title\":\"An Unrivaled Match: Hokage Battle Royale!\",\"number\":71,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru traps the Hokage inside a barrier and continue to battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"古今無双! 『火影』というレベルの戦い\"},{\"title\":\"A Mistake from the Past: A Face Revealed!\",\"number\":72,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke finally catches up to Gaara, Temari, and Kankuro. Kankuro escapes with Gaara leaving Temari to face Sasuke.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火影の過ち 仮面の下の素顔\"},{\"title\":\"Forbidden Secret Technique! Reaper Death Seal!\",\"number\":73,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between the Hokage and Orochimaru rages on. Finally, the Hokage resorts to a Jutsu unknown to Orochimaru, the Sealing Jutsu known as “Reaper Death Seal.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁術奥義! 『屍鬼封尽』\"},{\"title\":\"Astonishing Truth: Gaara`s Identity Emerges!\",\"number\":74,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shino appears as Sasuke and Kankuro battle. Leaving Shino to handle Kankuro, Sasuke goes after Gaara.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"驚愕! 我愛羅の正体\"},{\"title\":\"Sasuke`s Decision: Pushed to the Edge\",\"number\":75,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Half of Gaara’s body has transformed and Sasuke continues his battle against him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"限界を越えて... サスケの決断!!\"},{\"title\":\"An Assassin of the Moonlit Night\",\"number\":76,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"By the time Naruto and Sakura catch up, Sasuke has exhausted his strength and collapsed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月夜の暗殺者\"},{\"title\":\"Light vs. Dark: The Two Faces of Gaara\",\"number\":77,\"airDate\":\"2004-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is helpless against Gara’s immense power. While Naruto declares that he fights for his comrades, Gaara says he fights for himself.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"光と闇 我愛羅という名\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto`s Ninja Handbook\",\"number\":78,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is helpless against Gaara’s overpowering strength. However, after seeing Sasuke risking life and limb to save him and Sakura…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"爆発! これぞナルト忍法帖~~っ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Beyond the Limit of Darkness and Light\",\"number\":79,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is helpless against Gaara’s overpowering strength. However, after seeing Sasuke risking life and limb to save him and Sakura…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"リミットぶっちぎり! ~光と闇~\"},{\"title\":\"The Third Hokage, Forever...\",\"number\":80,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With every ounce of their power, Gaara and Naruto continue to fight. Determined to protect Sakura, Naruto attacks Gaara again and again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三代目よ, 永久に......!!\"},{\"title\":\"Return of the Morning Mist\",\"number\":81,\"airDate\":\"2004-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru`s plan to destroy the Village Hidden in the Leaves is stopped. But the damage is extensive and work proceeds quickly to make repairs.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"朝霧の帰郷\"},{\"title\":\"Eye to Eye: Sharingan vs. Sharingan!\",\"number\":82,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi arrives in the nick of time to help Asuma and Kurenai, and Itachi too enters the fray. The ultimate battle between two Sharingan users begins.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"写輪眼VS写輪眼!!\"},{\"title\":\"Jiraiya: Naruto`s Potential Disaster!\",\"number\":83,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya and Naruto are on a journey to find Tsunade, one of the legendary Sannin. Jiraiya`s purpose is both to protect Naruto from the clutches of the mysterious organization the Akatsuki and to train his apprentice.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"おお, のォ~っ! 自来也の女難, ナルトの災難\"},{\"title\":\"Roar, Chidori! Brother vs. Brother!\",\"number\":84,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Intent on confronting Itachi, Sasuke rushes to the town where Naruto is staying. On the way, tragic memories of his past come flooding back.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"唸れ千鳥 吠えろサスケ!\"},{\"title\":\"Hate Among the Uchihas: The Last of the Clan!\",\"number\":85,\"airDate\":\"2004-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya saves Naruto from Kisame just in time. It turns out that Itachi and the Akatsuki organization are definitely after Naruto to obtain the power of the Nine-Tailed Fox.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"愚かなる弟よ 恨め, 憎め!\"},{\"title\":\"A New Training Begins: I Will Be Strong!\",\"number\":86,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Deeply hurt mentally and physically, Sasuke is taken back to the Hidden Leaf Village by Guy. If only the medical specialist Tsunade were there...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"修行開始 オレはぜってー強くなる!\"},{\"title\":\"Keep on Training: Pop Goes the Water Balloon!\",\"number\":87,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto finally begins his training with Jiraiya. The technique Naruto will learn was the trademark of the Fourth Hokage, a technique which even a genius like him took three years to master.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"根性!!! 割れろ水風船!\"},{\"title\":\"Focal Point: The Mark of the Leaf\",\"number\":88,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto manages to complete the first step of his training. But the next step, making a rubber ball explode with chakra, proves extremely difficult.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉マークと額当て\"},{\"title\":\"An Impossible Choice: The Pain Within Tsunade`s Heart\",\"number\":89,\"airDate\":\"2004-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru and Kabuto suddenly appear before Tsunade and Shizune who are out sightseeing. Orochimaru, injured by the Third Hokage`s Reaper Death Seal, seeks the former Sannin`s medical expertise.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"波紋\"},{\"title\":\"Unforgivable! A Total Lack of Respect!\",\"number\":90,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In exchange for healing his arms, Orochimaru offers to bring back to life Tsunade`s younger brother Nawaki and Dan, her sweetheart.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りバクハツ! 許さねーってばよ\"},{\"title\":\"Inheritance! The Necklace of Death\",\"number\":91,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is incensed at the way Tsunade disrespects the position of Hokage and challenges her to a fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"初代火影の遺産 死を呼ぶ首飾り\"},{\"title\":\"A Dubious Offer! Tsunade`s Choice\",\"number\":92,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto practices hard so he can win the necklace from Tsunade. Meanwhile, Tsunade is in a dilemma over Orochimaru`s offer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"YESかNOか! ツナデの回答\"},{\"title\":\"Breakdown! The Deal Is Off!\",\"number\":93,\"airDate\":\"2004-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gripped by the desire to see Nawaki and Dan, Tsunade almost succumbs to Orochimaru`s tempting offer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"交渉決裂!!\"},{\"title\":\"Attack! Fury of the Rasengan!\",\"number\":94,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orochimaru and Kabuto use a summoning jutsu to call forth a giant snake. Still drugged and unable to fully use his chakra, Jiraiya summons little Gamakichi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"くらえ! 怒りの螺旋丸\"},{\"title\":\"The Fifth Hokage! A Life on the Line!\",\"number\":95,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto`s ninja way is to never go back on his word. Naruto is seriously injured by Kabuto and hovers on the verge of death.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"五代目火影 命を賭けた闘い!\"},{\"title\":\"Deadlock! Sannin Showdown!\",\"number\":96,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya, Tsunade and Orochimaru all release their summoning jutsu. And a fierce battle begins.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"三すくみの戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Kidnapped! Naruto`s Hot Springs Adventure!\",\"number\":97,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsunade, Naruto, and the others start heading back to the Leaf Village where Tsunade will formally become the Fifth Hokage. At Tsunade`s urging, they stop at a town with hot springs.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルトの湯けむり珍道中\"},{\"title\":\"Tsunade`s Warning: Ninja No More!\",\"number\":98,\"airDate\":\"2004-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto asks Tsunade to heal Sasuke and Lee before she is installed as the Hokage. After examining Lee, she tells him to find a path other than of that of a shinobi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍者を辞めろ! ツナデの通告\"},{\"title\":\"The Will of Fire Still Burns!\",\"number\":99,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lee hesitates when Tsunade asks him whether he will quit pursuing the path of a ninja or choose to undergo a risky surgery with only a fifty percent chance of success.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"火の意志を継ぐもの\"},{\"title\":\"The Sensei and the Student: Bond of the Shinobi\",\"number\":100,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After being advised by Tsunade to quit the path of the shinobi, Lee recalls his first meeting with his teacher Guy. Unable to master either ninjutsu or genjutsu, Lee has always been looked down upon by the others.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"熱血師弟の絆 ~男が忍道を貫くとき~\"},{\"title\":\"Gotta See! Gotta Know! Kakashi Sensei`s True Face!\",\"number\":101,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his two squadmates have always wanted to see what Kakashi looks like under his mask. The three do whatever they can to reveal his whole face.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"見たい, 知りたい, 確かめたい カカシ先生の素顔\"},{\"title\":\"Mission: Help an Old Friend in the Land of Tea\",\"number\":102,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, Sasuke, and Sakura are sent on a B-rank mission to the neighboring Land of Tea. They are to protect the runners in a race being held during the Todoroki Shrine`s ceremonial ritual held every four years.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"いざ新任務 義理と人情と茶国を救え!\"},{\"title\":\"The Race Is On! Trouble on the High Seas!\",\"number\":103,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The chief retainers think that Idate has made a farce of their great traditional festival. Jirocho believes that Idate has fled with some plan in mind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト撃沈!? 陰謀うずまく大海原\"},{\"title\":\"Run Idate Run! Nagi Island Awaits!\",\"number\":104,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and his squad manage to catch up to Idate, only to find him hurt and unconscious with Aoi nearby.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"走れイダテ! 嵐を呼ぶ波乱のナギ島!!\"},{\"title\":\"A Fierce Battle of Rolling Thunder!\",\"number\":105,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Despite interference from Aoi, Idate continues his run. Idate still trusts no one, and it`s revealed that during the Chunin Exams, Idate`s older brother was the proctor who posed the tenth question.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ゴール直前! 雷鳴とどろく大激闘\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Leg: A Final Act of Desperation\",\"number\":106,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Boss Jirocho waits, confident that Idate will win. But Aoi, the ninja sent by the Wagarashi clan, stands in the way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"届くかイダテ! 執念のラストスパート\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Begins: Naruto vs. Sasuke\",\"number\":107,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru is promoted to chunin, and he and his squadmates celebrate at a BBQ restaurant. In the hospital, Lee decides to undergo a dangerous surgery to repair his body so that he can remain a ninja.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"オマエと戦いたい! ついに激突, サスケVSナルト\"},{\"title\":\"Bitter Rivals and Broken Bonds\",\"number\":108,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Sasuke release their ultimate weapons against each other, and just in time Kakashi arrives to stop the fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"見えない亀裂\"},{\"title\":\"An Invitation from the Sound\",\"number\":109,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Sound Ninja Four, Kidomaru, Sakon, Jirobo and Tayuya, suddenly appear before Sasuke. Sakura is concerned about the Curse Mark placed on Sasuke by Orochimaru...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"音の誘い\"},{\"title\":\"Formation! The Sasuke Retrieval Squad!\",\"number\":110,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura`s pleas fall on deaf ears, and Sasuke leaves Hidden Leaf Village. When Tsunade learns of this, she summons Shikamaru to lead his first mission as a chunin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結成! 鉄壁のフォーメーション\"},{\"title\":\"Sound vs. Leaf\",\"number\":111,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Sound Ninja Four race toward Orochimaru`s lair with Sasuke in hand. They`re discovered and challenged by the jonin Genma and Raido...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"接触~音四人衆の実力~\"},{\"title\":\"Squad Mutiny: Everything Falls Apart!\",\"number\":112,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others are trapped in Jirobo`s Earth Dome Prison. They try to pound their way out, but the walls regenerate each time.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"イキナリ仲間割れ!? シカマル小隊大ピンチ\"},{\"title\":\"Full Throttle Power! Choji, Ablaze!\",\"number\":113,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After they are freed from the Earth Dome Prison, Shikamaru and the others take off after the remaining Sound while Choji stays behind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"パワー全開! 燃えろチョウジ\"},{\"title\":\"Good-Bye Old Friend! I`ll Always Believe in You!\",\"number\":114,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Choji takes the yellow pill it looks as if he may win the battle, until Jirobo transforms into Second State, giving him immense power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さらば友よ...! それでもオレは信じてる\"},{\"title\":\"Your Opponent Is Me!\",\"number\":115,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Assuming that the Leaf Squad could never get past Jirobo, the remaining Sound ninja don`t bother to lay traps along the way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"お前の相手はこのオレだ!\"},{\"title\":\"360 Degrees of Vision: The Byakugan`s Blind Spot!\",\"number\":116,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Neji takes on Kidomaru while the others continue their pursuit of Sasuke and the remaining Sound ninja.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"視界360度 白眼の死角\"},{\"title\":\"Losing Is Not an Option\",\"number\":117,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kidomaru changes tactics and creates a bow and arrow to attack Neji`s blind spot.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"負けられない理由\"},{\"title\":\"The Vessel Arrives Too Late\",\"number\":118,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, Shikamaru, Kiba and Akamaru are in hot pursuit of Sasuke and the Sound ninja. Naruto and Kiba are upset that they have been unable to catch up and decide to try a surprise attack at night.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奪還 ~間に合わなかった器~\"},{\"title\":\"Miscalculation: A New Enemy Appears!\",\"number\":119,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Akamaru sets explosives in the trees to trap Sakon. But an incensed Sakon turns the tables, and the explosives end up sending Kiba, Akamaru and Sakon off a cliff.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失策! 新たなる敵\"},{\"title\":\"Roar! Howl! The Ultimate Tag\",\"number\":120,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru is determined to stop Tayuya, but she uses her Summoning Jutsu to call forth three giants. Meanwhile, on the plains, the battle between Kimimaro and Naruto is about to begin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"唸れ! 吼えろ! 究極のタッグ\"},{\"title\":\"Our Separate Battles\",\"number\":121,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ukon, who is able to infiltrate the bodies of others, enters Kiba`s body and tries to merge with his cells.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"それぞれの闘い\"},{\"title\":\"Fake! Shikamaru the Man, Who Bets on the Revival of the Dead.\",\"number\":122,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An injured Kiba and Akamaru barely escape from Sakon and Ukon. Naruto is locked in battle with Kimimaro...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フェイク! 男シカマル 起死回生の賭け\"},{\"title\":\"Konoha`s Green Beast Appears\",\"number\":123,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru succeeds in trapping Tayuya with his Shadow Possession Jutsu. But Tayuya moves to her Second State and fights back with enormous strength.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉の碧き野獣 見参!\"},{\"title\":\"The Beast Explodes! Burst, Blow, and Break Through\",\"number\":124,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With Rock Lee there to take on Kimimaro, Naruto is free to chase after Sasuke, who has awakened.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"野獣炸裂! 弾けろ吹っ飛べ突き抜けろ!\"},{\"title\":\"Allies of Konoha! The Shinobi of the Sand!\",\"number\":125,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru, Kiba and Lee are at the limits of their strength when Gaara, Temari and Kankuro appear to assist their Leaf allies.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉同盟国 砂の忍\"},{\"title\":\"Showdown of the Strongest! Gaara vs. Kimimaro!!\",\"number\":126,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kimimaro realizes that close combat is impossible against Gaara`s wall of sand, so he moves further away for a long-distance attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強対決! 我愛羅VS君麻呂!\"},{\"title\":\"Determination for One Blow! Dance of The Seeding Ferns\",\"number\":127,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kimimaro succeeds in shattering Gaara`s protective sand shield and attacks Gaara. Naruto finally catches up to Sasuke...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"執念の一撃! 早蕨の舞\"},{\"title\":\"Unreachable Outcry\",\"number\":128,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the Curse Mark covering half his body, Sasuke is no longer the Sasuke of old. Naruto charges at this new Sasuke who has turned his back on his closest comrades.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"届かない叫び\"},{\"title\":\"Itachi and Sasuke. An Existence Too Far Apart.\",\"number\":129,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto tries desperately to change Sasuke`s mind, but Sasuke is determined to go to Orochimaru. He tells Naruto that in order to surpass his brother, Itachi, power and hatred are necessary.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"兄[イタチ]と弟[サスケ] 遠すぎる存在\"},{\"title\":\"Father and Son. The Cracked Family Crest\",\"number\":130,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is brought down by Sasuke`s Fire Style: Fireball Jutsu. It is a jutsu passed down through generations of the Uchiha family...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"父と子 ひび割れた家紋\"},{\"title\":\"Enlightenment. The Secret of Mangekyou Sharingan.\",\"number\":131,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sasuke quietly watches as Naruto sinks deeper in the water. He recalls the past, when the Uchiha clan was cruelly slaughtered.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"開眼 万華鏡写輪眼の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Close Friend!\",\"number\":132,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kakashi uses his Summoning Jutsu and sends ninja dogs to track Naruto and Sasuke. With his newfound strength, Sasuke is serious about bringing down Naruto...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"親友[とも]よ!\"},{\"title\":\"Tearful Yell! You Are My Friend.\",\"number\":133,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto releases his Nine-Tail chakra and sends Sasuke flying. Sasuke counters with his Fire Style Jutsu, but Naruto extinguishes the flames easily.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙の咆哮! オマエはオレの友達だ\"},{\"title\":\"Concluded in a Rain of Tears\",\"number\":134,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto`s Nine-Tail chakra seems to move with a will of its own as it counters Sasuke`s powerful attacks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙雨[なみだあめ]の結末\"},{\"title\":\"The Promise That Couldn`t Be Kept\",\"number\":135,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The fierce battle with Sasuke leaves Naruto unconscious. Kakashi finally arrives at his side.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"守れなかった約束\"},{\"title\":\"Infiltration investigation?! A Super S-Class Mission Has Finally Arrived!\",\"number\":136,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura tries to sneak out of the village to find Sasuke, but Naruto intercepts her.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入捜査!? 遂にきたきた超S級任務\"},{\"title\":\"The Town of Outlaws. The Shadow of the Fuuma Clan.\",\"number\":137,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, Sakura and Jiraiya search for information in a town in the Land of Rice Paddies.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"無法者の街 ふうま一族の影\"},{\"title\":\"A Pure Betrayal. A Fleeting Wish.\",\"number\":138,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, Sakura and Sasame are attacked by Kamikiri, Jigumo and Kagero of the Fuma Clan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"清き裏切り はかなき願い\"},{\"title\":\"Terror! Orochimaru`s Mansion\",\"number\":139,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jiraiya uses his Summoning Jutsu to call out Gamakichi. With Gamakichi leading the way, the shinobi advance up winding stairways and through long tunnels.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖! 大蛇丸の館\"},{\"title\":\"Two Heartbeats, Kabuto`s Trap\",\"number\":140,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sakura is cornered by Orochimaru! Just as Kabuto is about to hurl his kunai at her, Naruto comes running in.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二つの鼓動 カブトの罠\"},{\"title\":\"Sakura`s Decision\",\"number\":141,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto tries to shield Sakura from an attack and is wounded by Kamikiri. Naruto laughs off his injury and counters with his Shadow Clone Jutsu...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"サクラの決意\"},{\"title\":\"Three Villians of the Strictly Guarded Facility\",\"number\":142,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto gets upset when Jiraiya sets out on a sudden mission without him. Jiraiya tells him to undergo special training during his absence and hands him a scroll.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"厳戒施設の三悪人\"},{\"title\":\"Run Tonton! We`re Counting On Your Nose\",\"number\":143,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shizune pursues Mizuki who has escaped from the Maximum Security Prison, but is overcome by him and the brothers Raijin and Fujin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"走れトントン! お前の鼻が頼りだってばよ\"},{\"title\":\"Rebirth of the Three Man Team: Two People and One Animal\",\"number\":144,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Raijin and Fujin possess superhuman strength, and Naruto is no match for them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新生三人一組[スリーマンセル] 二人と一匹!\"},{\"title\":\"Explosion! New Formation InoShikaChou\",\"number\":145,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shikamaru, Ino and Choji come to the rescue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"炸裂! ニューフォーメーションいのシカチョウ\"},{\"title\":\"Leftover Ambitions Orochimaru`s Shadow\",\"number\":146,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto discovers that Tsubaki is Mizuki`s fiancee. She has an idea of his whereabouts and asks the squad to take her with them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"残された野望 大蛇丸の影\"},{\"title\":\"Confrontation of Fate! You Will Not Defeat Me\",\"number\":147,\"airDa