hief Gosunkugi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵か味方か!? 荒野の賞金稼ぎ\"},{\"title\":\"Will We Take It or Will It Be Taken from Us!? The Okay Temple`s Battle\",\"number\":160,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others tend to an injured Sazanami. As Sazanami tells it, he had once been a swordsmith in a peaceful town and was framed for a murder committed by Gosunkugi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"獲るか獲られるか!? オッケー寺の決斗\"},{\"title\":\"A Welcome Visitor Arrives: The Green Beast? The Carnivore? ...The Welcomed Beast?\",\"number\":161,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Guy and Lee are away, two impostors dressed like them sneak into Hidden Leaf Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"珍客見参 碧の野獣? 猛獣? ...珍獣?\"},{\"title\":\"A Cursed White Warrior\",\"number\":162,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Land of Birds is in turmoil due to a specter known as the Cursed Warrior, which is believed to be the ghost of Lord Owashi, the previous feudal lord who died suddenly.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白き呪いの武者\"},{\"title\":\"Tactician: Koumei`s Speculation\",\"number\":163,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Moso, the late feudal lord`s counselor, and Komei, the chief strategist, are at odds with each other. Neji begins to think that the Cursed Warrior is part of a plot\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"策士・紅明の思惑\"},{\"title\":\"The Helper Who Came Too Late\",\"number\":164,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Komei is controlling the Cursed Warrior. Moso thwarts Komei`s ambitions. The Leaf team feels uneasy about his motives. Neji doesn`t want to get involved, but Naruto is defiant. Gamakichi and Gamatatsu is summoned to investigate...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遅すぎた助っ人\"},{\"title\":\"Naruto Dies\",\"number\":165,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tenten and Neji have no choice but to listen to Kakashi. He senses that their being followed. Komei has been declared a criminal and is to be executed. The Cursed Warrior appears and snatches Komei away.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナルト死す\"},{\"title\":\"Time Is Stopped\",\"number\":166,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sagi swears to punish Moso himself. Naruto is reminded of Sasuke when he sees Sagi. Neither words nor Naruto`s attempts to stop him can deter Sagi from his chosen path of revenge.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"止まったままの時間\"},{\"title\":\"White Heron`s Flapping Wings of Time\",\"number\":167,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At Moso`s mansion, a battle takes place between the Wandering Ninja and a Leaf Ninja. With Chishima`s help, Naruto is freed from Moso`s genjutsu. Moso then reveals his true form as the leader of the Wandering ninja, Hoki!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白鷺の羽ばたく時間\"},{\"title\":\"Burn Zundou! Mix, Stretch and Boil It Up!\",\"number\":168,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Choji and Naruto is craving Ichiraku`s special ramen only to find out that they find the shop closed! Teuchi reveals that his daughter has been kidnapped by Ryonin, aka the Ninja Chefs, who is after his secret recipes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"燃えろ寸胴! 混ぜて伸ばして茹で上げろ!!\"},{\"title\":\"Remembrance: The Lost Page\",\"number\":169,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Demon of the Ocean is wreaking havoc in the Land of the Sea. Anko leads a team consisting with Naruto, Ino, and Shino. It turns out Anko has an unexpected history with the Land of the Sea.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"記憶 失われた頁[ページ]\"},{\"title\":\"Impact: The Closed Door\",\"number\":170,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Unable to find Naruto, Anko meets with officials from the Land of the Sea. The ship carrying government funds that they were supposed to guard sets sail the next day!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃 閉ざされた扉[ドア]\"},{\"title\":\"Sneaking: The Planned Trap\",\"number\":171,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Unable to find Naruto, Anko meets with officials from the Land of the Sea. The ship carrying government funds that they were supposed to guard sets sail the next day!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"潜入 仕組まれた罠[トラップ]\"},{\"title\":\"Despair: The Broken Heart\",\"number\":172,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Amachi and his gang begin their attack on the government ship. Naruto and the others escape from Demon Island, but the sight that greets them is the Land of the Sea fleet on the verge of annihilation.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望 引き裂かれた心[ハート]\"},{\"title\":\"Sea Battle: The Released Power\",\"number\":173,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Hidden Leaf ninja and Amachi battle it out at sea. With Naruto`s help, Amachi is defeated, but then a monster appears. Naruto summons Gamabunta in order to defeat the monster.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"海戦 解き放たれた力[パワー]\"},{\"title\":\"No Way! Celebrity Ninpou: Jutsu of Gold Element\",\"number\":174,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kunijiro visists Tsunade and decides to have Naruto guide his boy through one day in the life of a ninja!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ありえねーってばよ! セレブ忍法・金遁[きんとん]の術\"},{\"title\":\"Dig Here! Woof! Woof! The Search for Buried Treasure\",\"number\":175,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto, Kiba, and Hinata are searching for buried treasue at the request of Tsunade`s friend Agari Kaisen. Thinking it`s an easy task since they have a map, Tsunade threatens to send them back to the Academy if they fail.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ここ掘れワンワン! 埋蔵金[まいぞうきん]を探せ\"},{\"title\":\"Zigzag Running! Chasing, Being Chased, Making a Mistake\",\"number\":176,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After escaping from the cave, Naruto and the others chase after the Kedouin in order to put a halt to their plot, but the Village Hidden in the Leaves is already under attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"疾走, 迷走, ジグザグ走! 追って追われて間違えて\"},{\"title\":\"Oh?! Please, Mister Postman.\",\"number\":177,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto discovers Jiraiya is up to no good. Jiraiya claims to be busy getting his manuscript ready before his deadline. Impatient and irritated, Naruto writes his own manuscript for Jiraiya!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"OH!? ぷりーず みすたーぽすとまん\"},{\"title\":\"Encounter: The Boy Named `Hoshi`.\",\"number\":178,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hidden Leaf Village receives a request from the Village Hidden in the Stars to guard a star. The star is actually a meteorite that fell 200 years ago and is said to possess mysterious powers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"出会い 「星」の名を持つ少年\"},{\"title\":\"Natsuhiboshi: Remembered Lullaby\",\"number\":179,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others investigates the whereabouts of the stolen star. The team suspects that is an inside job because the ninja who took the star used the ninja art, Kujaku, from the Star Village.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ナツヒボシ 思い出の子守唄\"},{\"title\":\"Secret Technique: Compensation of Peacock Mysteries.\",\"number\":180,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-12\",\"duratio