as the \\\"Onbaa.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"木ノ葉隠れの伝説 オンバアは実在した!!\"},{\"title\":\"Laugh Shino\",\"number\":186,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and Shino are given a mission to provide security during the Kagetsu family funeral, but they soon realize that the real mission is to help the eldest son carry out the man`s unusual last will and testament!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"笑うシノ\"},{\"title\":\"Open for Business!! Konoha House Moving Center\",\"number\":187,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A ominous black smoke appears over the Land of Greens, and all of sudden Choji and company are attacked by an unidentified Ninja!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"開業!! 木ノ葉引越センター\"},{\"title\":\"Mystery: The Targeted Peddler\",\"number\":188,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While questioning Yurinoshin and Shun, the Hidden Leaf squad learns the truth about Shun`s true identity. She is Princess Haruna, the only daughter of the Feudal Lord of the Land of Greens!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"不可解 狙われた行商人\"},{\"title\":\"Underwater! An Inexhaustible Amount of Ninja Weapons\",\"number\":189,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto and the others is attacked by Ruiga, the first evil ninja, who can draw water from the earth to use as weapons. Naruto soon discovers a way to reverse the odds of their battle!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"地下水 無尽蔵の忍具\"},{\"title\":\"Byakugan Saw It! The Magnet User`s Blind Spot\",\"number\":190,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naruto is again attacked by the second evil ninja, Jiga. Jiga threatens Naruto`s life when Hinata rushes in to save Naruto, but Hinata resists the threats and begins to fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":